# Plan 9 source, kept LOCAL for reference and provenance — never built, never
# edited, never committed. The same role ../ipnx plays for V10: a claim about
# Plan 9 must trace to file and line, and it cannot if the source is not here
# to cite.
#
#   plan9/        the 9legacy tree — 4th edition with the maintained patches
#                 applied, which is what a claim should be checked against
#   plan9-stock/  the raw final Labs release, kept so a difference can be
#                 attributed: 778 files under sys/src differ between them
#
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/0intro/9legacy plan9
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/plan9foundation/plan9 plan9-stock
plan9/
plan9-stock/
